    owl:unionOf ( <https://admin-shell.io/aas/3/0/RC02/QualifierKind#ValueQualifier> <https://admin-shell.io/aas/3/0/RC02/QualifierKind#ConceptQualifier> <https://admin-shell.io/aas/3/0/RC02/QualifierKind#TemplateQualifier> ) ;
    linkml:permissible_values <https://admin-shell.io/aas/3/0/RC02/QualifierKind#ConceptQualifier>,
        <https://admin-shell.io/aas/3/0/RC02/QualifierKind#TemplateQualifier>,
