    owl:unionOf ( <https://admin-shell.io/aas/3/0/RC02/LevelType#Min> <https://admin-shell.io/aas/3/0/RC02/LevelType#Max> <https://admin-shell.io/aas/3/0/RC02/LevelType#Nom> <https://admin-shell.io/aas/3/0/RC02/LevelType#Typ> ) ;
